==English==
[[Image:Rolling-thunder-cloud.jpg|thumb|Shelf cloud, a type of '''arcus''']]

===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|arcus}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|arci}}

# {{label|en|medicine}} A white band of [[cholesterol]] that forms at the edge of the [[cornea]]
# {{label|en|meteorology}} A low, [[horizontal]] [[cloud]] typically forming at the leading edge of thunderstorm [[outflow]]
# {{label|en|entomology}} An elastic band around the base of the [[arolium]], a pad at the end of the leg of certain insects
# {{label|en|palynology}} An arc-shaped band of thickened [[sexine]] extending between two [[aperture]]s on a pollen grain or spore

